","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":24,"width":144,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":48,"width":410,"height":120},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"廣い門の下には、この男の外に誰もゐない。唯、所々丹","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":48,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"塗の剝げた、大きな圓柱に、蟋蟀が一匹とまつてゐる。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":72,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"羅生門が、朱雀大路にある以上は、この男の外にも、雨","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":96,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"やみをする市女笠や揉烏帽子が、もう二三人はありさう","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":120,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"なものである。それが、この男の外には誰もゐない。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":144,"width":384,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":168,"width":410,"height":312},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"何故かと云ふと、この二三年、京都には、地震とか辻風","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":168,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"とか火事とか饑饉とか云ふ災がつゞいて起つた。そこで","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":192,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"洛中のさびれ方は一通りでない。舊記によると、佛像や","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":216,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"佛具を打碎いて、その丹がついたり、金銀の箔がついた","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":240,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りした木を、路ばたにつみ重ねて、薪の料に賣つてゐた","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":264,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と云ふ事である。洛中がその始末であるから、羅生門の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":288,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"修理などは、元より誰も捨てゝ顧る者がなかつた。する","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":312,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"とその荒れ果てたのをよい事にして、狐狸が棲む。盜人","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":336,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"が棲む。とうとうしまひには、引取り手のない死人を、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":360,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"この門へ持つて來て、棄てゝ行くと云ふ習慣さへ出來","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":384,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。そこで、日の目が見えなくなると、誰でも氣味を惡","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":408,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"るがつて、この門の近所へは足ぶみをしない事になつて","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":432,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"しまつたのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":456,"width":144,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":480,"width":410,"height":288},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"その代り又鴉が何處からか、たくさん集つて來た。晝間","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":480,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"見ると、その鴉が何羽となく輪を描いて高い鴟尾のまは","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":504,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りを啼きながら、飛びまはつてゐる。殊に門の上の空","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":528,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"が、夕燒けであかくなる時には、それが胡麻をまいたや","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":552,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"うにはつきり見えた。鴉は、勿論、門の上にある死人の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":576,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"肉を、啄みに來るのである。――尤も今日は、刻限が遲","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":600,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"いせいか、一羽も見えない。唯、所々、崩れかゝつた、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":624,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"さうしてその崩れ目に長い草のはへた石段の上に、鴉の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":648,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"糞が、點々と白くこびりついてゐるのが見える。下人は","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":672,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"七段ある石段の一番上の段に洗ひざらした紺の襖の尻を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":696,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"据ゑて、右の頰に出來た、大きな面皰を氣にしながら、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":720,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ぼんやり、雨のふるのを眺めてゐるのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":744,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":768,"width":410,"height":408},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"作者はさつき、「下人が雨やみを待つてゐた」と書い","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":768,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。しかし、下人は、雨がやんでも格別どうしようと云","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":792,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ふ當てはない。ふだんなら、勿論、主人の家へ歸る可き","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":816,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"筈である。所がその主人からは、四五日前に暇を出され","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":840,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。前にも書いたやうに、當時京都の町は一通りならず","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":864,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"衰微してゐた。今この下人が、永年、使はれてゐた主人","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":888,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"から、暇を出されたのも、この衰微の小さな餘波に外な","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":912,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"らない。だから「下人が雨やみを待つてゐた」と云ふよ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":936,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りも、「雨にふりこめられた下人が、行き所がなくて、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":960,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"途方にくれてゐた」と云ふ方が、適當である。その上、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":984,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"今日の空模樣も少からずこの平安朝の下人の ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1008,"width":320,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"Sentimentalisme に影響した。申の刻下りからふり出し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1032,"width":402.78,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た雨は、未に上るけしきがない。そこで、下人は、何を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1056,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"措いても差當り明日の暮しをどうにかしようとして――","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1080,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"云はゞどうにもならない事を、どうにかしようとして、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1104,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"とりとめもない考へをたどりながら、さつきから朱雀大","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1128,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"路にふる雨の音を、聞くともなく聞いてゐた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1152,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1176,"width":410,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"雨は、羅生門をつゝんで、遠くから、ざあつと云ふ音を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1176,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"あつめて來る。夕闇は次第に空を低くして、見上げる","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1200,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と、門の屋根が、斜につき出した甍の先に、重たくうす","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1224,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"暗い雲を支へてゐる。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1248,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1272,"width":410,"height":288},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"どうにもならない事を、どうにかする爲には、手段を選","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1272,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"んでゐる遑はない。選んでゐれば、築土の下か、道ばた","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1296,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の土の上で、饑死をするばかりである。さうして、この","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1320,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"門の上へ持つて來て、犬のやうに棄てられてしまふばか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1344,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りである。選ばないとすれば――下人の考へは、何度も","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1368,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"同じ道を低徊した揚句に、やつとこの局所へ逢着した。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1392,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"しかしこの「すれば」は、何時までたつても、結局「す","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1416,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"れば」であつた。下人は、手段を選ばないといふ事を肯","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1440,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"定しながらも、この「すれば」のかたをつける爲に、當","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1464,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"然、その後に來る可き「盜人になるより外に仕方がな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1488,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"い」と云ふ事を、積極的に肯定する丈の、勇氣が出ずに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1512,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ゐたのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1536,"width":112,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1560,"width":410,"height":120},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、大きな嚏をして、それから、大儀さうに立上つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1560,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。夕冷えのする京都は、もう火桶が欲しい程の寒さで","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1584,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ある。風は門の柱と柱との間を、夕闇と共に遠慮なく、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1608,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"吹きぬける。丹塗の柱にとまつてゐた蟋蟀も、もうどこ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1632,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"かへ行つてしまつた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1656,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1680,"width":410,"height":240},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、頸をちゞめながら、山吹の汗衫に重ねた、紺の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1680,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"襖の肩を高くして門のまはりを見まはした。雨風の患の","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1704,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ない、人目にかゝる惧のない、一晚樂にねられさうな所","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1728,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"があれば、そこでともかくも、夜を明かさうと思つたか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1752,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"らである。すると、幸門の上の樓へ上る、幅の廣い、之","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1776,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"も丹を塗つた梯子が眼についた。上なら、人がゐたにし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1800,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ても、どうせ死人ばかりである。下人は、そこで腰にさ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1824,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"げた聖柄の太刀が鞘走らないやうに氣をつけながら、藁","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1848,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"草履をはいた足を、その梯子の一番下の段へふみかけ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1872,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1896,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1920,"width":410,"height":312},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"それから、何分かの後である。羅生門の樓の上へ出る、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1920,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"幅の廣い梯子の中段に、一人の男が、猫のやうに身を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1944,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ちゞめて、息を殺しながら、上の容子を窺つてゐた。樓","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1968,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の上からさす火の光が、かすかに、その男の右の頰をぬ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1992,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"らしてゐる。短い鬚の中に、赤く膿を持つた面皰のある","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2016,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"頰である。下人は、始めから、この上にゐる者は、死人","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2040,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ばかりだと高を括つてゐた。それが、梯子を二三段上つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2064,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て見ると、上では誰か火をとぼして、しかもその火を其","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2088,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"處此處と動かしてゐるらしい。これは、その濁つた、黃","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2112,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"いろい光が、隅々に蜘蛛の巢をかけた天井裏に、ゆれな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2136,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"がら映つたので、すぐにそれと知れたのである。この雨","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2160,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の夜に、この羅生門の上で、火をともしてゐるからは、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2184,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"どうせ唯の者ではない。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2208,"width":176,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2232,"width":410,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、守宮のやうに足音をぬすんで、やつと急な梯子","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2232,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を、一番上の段まで這ふやうにして上りつめた。さうし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2256,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て體を出來る丈、平にしながら、頸を出來る丈、前へ出","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2280,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"して、恐る恐る、樓の內を覗いて見た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2304,"width":288,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2328,"width":410,"height":288},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"見ると、樓の內には、噂に聞いた通り、幾つかの屍骸","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2328,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"が、無造作に棄てゝあるが、火の光の及ぶ範圍が、思つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2352,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"たより狹いので、數は幾つともわからない。唯、おぼろ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2376,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"げながら、知れるのは、その中に裸の屍骸と、着物を着","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2400,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た屍骸とがあると云ふ事である。勿論、中には女も男も","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2424,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"まじつてゐるらしい。さうして、その屍骸は皆、それ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2448,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"が、甞、生きてゐた人間だと云ふ事實さへ疑はれる程、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2472,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"土を捏ねて造つた人形のやうに、口を開いたり手を延ば","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2496,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"したりしてごろごろ床の上にころがつてゐた。しかも、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2520,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"肩とか胸とかの高くなつてゐる部分に、ぼんやりした火","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2544,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の光をうけて、低くなつてゐる部分の影を一層暗くしな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2568,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"がら、永久に啞の如く默つていた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2592,"width":256,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2616,"width":410,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、それらの屍骸の腐爛した臭氣に思はず、鼻を掩","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2616,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"つた。しかし、その手は、次の瞬間には、もう鼻を掩ふ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2640,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"事を忘れてゐた。或る强い感情が、殆悉この男の嗅覺を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"奪つてしまつたからである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2688,"width":208,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2712,"width":410,"height":144},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人の眼は、その時、はじめて、其屍骸の中に蹲つてい","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2712,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る人間を見た。檜肌色の着物を著た、背の低い、瘦せ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2736,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た、白髮頭の、猿のやうな老婆である。その老婆は、右","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2760,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の手に火をともした松の木片を持つて、その屍骸の一つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2784,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の顏を覗きこむやうに眺めてゐた。髮の毛の長い所を見","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2808,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ると、多分女の屍骸であらう。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2832,"width":224,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2856,"width":410,"height":192},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、六分の恐怖と四分の好奇心とに動かされて、暫","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2856,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"時は呼吸をするのさへ忘れてゐた。舊記の記者の語を借","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2880,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"りれば、「頭身の毛も太る」やうに感じたのである。す","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2904,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ると、老婆は、松の木片を、床板の間に挿して、それか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2928,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、今まで眺めてゐた屍骸の首に兩手をかけると、丁","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2952,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"度、猿の親が猿の子の虱をとるやうに、その長い髮の毛","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2976,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を一本づゝ拔きはじめた。髮は手に從つて拔けるらし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3000,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"い。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3024,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3048,"width":410,"height":288},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"その髮の毛が、一本ずゝ拔けるのに從つて下人の心から","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3048,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、恐怖が少しづつ消えて行つた。さうして、それと同","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3072,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"時に、この老婆に對するはげしい憎惡が、少しづゝ動い","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3096,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て來た。――いや、この老婆に對すると云つては、語弊","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3120,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"があるかも知れない。寧、あらゆる惡に對する反感が、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3144,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"一分每に强さを增して來たのである。この時、誰かがこ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3168,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の下人に、さつき門の下でこの男が考へてゐた、饑死を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3192,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"するか盜人になるかと云ふ問題を、改めて持出したら、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3216,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"恐らく下人は、何の未練もなく、饑死を選んだ事であら","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3240,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"う。それほど、この男の惡を憎む心は、老婆の床に挿し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3264,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"た松の木片のやうに、勢よく燃え上り出してゐたのであ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3288,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3312,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3336,"width":410,"height":168},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人には、勿論、何故老婆が死人の髮の毛を拔くかわか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3336,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"らなかつた。從つて、合理的には、それを善惡の何れに","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3360,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"片づけてよいか知らなかつた。しかし下人にとつては、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3384,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"この雨の夜に、この羅生門の上で、死人の髮の毛を拔く","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3408,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と云ふ事が、それ丈で既に許す可らざる惡であつた。勿","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3432,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"論、下人は、さつき迄自分が、盜人になる氣でゐた事な","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3456,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ぞは、とうに忘れてゐるのである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3480,"width":256,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3504,"width":410,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"そこで、下人は、兩足に力を入れて、いきなり、梯子か","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3504,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら上へ飛び上つた。さうして聖柄の太刀に手をかけなが","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3528,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、大股に老婆の前へ步みよつた。老婆が驚いたのは、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3552,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"云ふ迄もない。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3576,"width":112,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3600,"width":410,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"老婆は、一目下人を見ると、まるで弩にでも彈かれたや","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3600,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"うに、飛び上つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3624,"width":144,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3648,"width":410,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「おのれ、どこへ行く。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3648,"width":192,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3672,"width":410,"height":192},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、老婆が屍骸につまづきながら、慌てふためいて","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3672,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"逃げようとする行手を塞いで、こう罵つた。老婆は、そ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3696,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"れでも下人をつきのけて行かうとする。下人は又、それ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3720,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を行かすまいとして、押しもどす。二人は屍骸の中で、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3744,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"暫、無言のまゝ、つかみ合つた。しかし勝敗は、はじめ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3768,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"から、わかつている。下人はとうとう、老婆の腕をつか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3792,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"んで、無理にそこへ扭ぢ倒した。丁度、鷄の脚のやう","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3816,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"な、骨と皮ばかりの腕である。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3840,"width":224,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3864,"width":410,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「何をしてゐた。さあ何をしてゐた。云へ。云はぬと、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3864,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"これだぞよ。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3888,"width":112,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3912,"width":410,"height":288},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、老婆をつき放すと、いきなり、太刀の鞘を拂つ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3912,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て、白い鋼の色をその眼の前へつきつけた。けれども、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3936,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"老婆は默つてゐる。兩手をわなわなふるはせて、肩で息","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3960,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を切りながら、眼を、眼球が眶の外へ出さうになる程、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3984,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"見開いて、啞のやうに執拗く默つてゐる。これを見る","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4008,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と、下人は始めて明白にこの老婆の生死が、全然、自分","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4032,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の意志に支配されてゐると云ふ事を意識した。さうし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4056,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て、この意識は、今まではげしく燃えてゐた憎惡の心を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4080,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"何時の間にか冷ましてしまつた。後に殘つたのは、唯、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4104,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"或仕事をして、それが圓滿に成就した時の、安らかな得","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4128,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"意と滿足とがあるばかりである。そこで、下人は、老婆","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4152,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を見下しながら、少し聲を柔げてかう云つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4176,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4200,"width":410,"height":120},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「己は檢非違使の廳の役人などではない。今し方この門","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4200,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の下を通りかゝつた旅の者だ。だからお前に繩をかけ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4224,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て、どうしようと云ふやうな事はない。唯、今時分、こ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4248,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の門の上で、何をして居たのだか、それを己に話しさへ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4272,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"すればいいのだ。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4296,"width":144,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4320,"width":410,"height":168},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"すると、老婆は、見開いてゐた眼を、一層大きくして、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4320,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ぢつとその下人の顏を見守つた。眶の赤くなつた、肉食","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4344,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"鳥のやうな、銳い眼で見たのである。それから、皺で、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4368,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"殆、鼻と一つになつた唇を、何か物でも嚙んでゐるやう","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4392,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"に動かした。細い喉で、尖つた喉佛の動いてゐるのが見","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4416,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"える。その時、その喉から、鴉の啼くやうな聲が、喘ぎ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4440,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"喘ぎ、下人の耳へ傳はつて來た。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4464,"width":240,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4488,"width":410,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「この髮を拔いてな、この女の髮を拔いてな、鬘にせう","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4488,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"と思うたのぢや。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4512,"width":144,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4536,"width":410,"height":144},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、老婆の答が存外、平凡なのに失望した。さうし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4536,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て失望すると同時に、又前の憎惡が、冷な侮蔑と一しよ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4560,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"に、心の中へはいつて來た。すると、その氣色が、先方","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4584,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"へも通じたのであらう。老婆は、片手に、まだ屍骸の頭","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4608,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"から奪つた長い拔け毛を持つたなり、蟇のつぶやくやう","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4632,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"な聲で、口ごもりながら、こんな事を云つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4656,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":4680,"width":410,"height":384},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"成程、死人の髮の毛を拔くと云ふ事は、惡い事かも知れ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4680,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ぬ。しかし、かう云ふ死人の多くは、皆、その位な事","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4704,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"を、されてもいゝ人間ばかりである。現に、自分が今、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4728,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"髮を拔いた女などは、蛇を四寸ばかりづゝに切つて干し","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4752,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"たのを、干魚だと云つて、太刀帶の陣へ賣りに行つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4776,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"疫病にかゝつて死ななかつたなら、今でも賣りに行つて","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4800,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ゐたかもしれない。しかも、この女の賣る干魚は、味が","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4824,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"よいと云ふので、太刀帶たちが、缺かさず菜料に買つて","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4848,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ゐたのである。自分は、この女のした事が惡いとは思は","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4872,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ない。しなければ、饑死をするので、仕方がなくした事","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4896,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"だからである。だから、又今、自分のしてゐた事も惡い","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4920,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"事とは思はない。これもやはりしなければ、饑死をする","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4944,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ので、仕方がなくする事だからである。さうして、その","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4968,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"仕方がない事を、よく知つてゐたこの女は、自分のする","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":4992,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"事を許してくれるのにちがひないと思ふからである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5016,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"――老婆は、大體こんな意味の事を云つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5040,"width":320,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5064,"width":410,"height":288},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、太刀を鞘におさめて、その太刀の柄を左の手で","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5064,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"おさへながら、冷然として、この話を聞いてゐた。勿","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5088,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"論、右の手では、赤く頰に膿を持つた大きな面皰を氣に","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5112,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"しながら、聞いてゐるのである。しかし、之を聞いてゐ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5136,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"る中に、下人の心には、或勇氣が生まれて來た。それ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5160,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"は、さつき、門の下でこの男に缺けてゐた勇氣である。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5184,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"さうして、又さつき、この門の上へ上つて、この老婆を","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5208,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"捕へた時の勇氣とは、全然、反對な方向に動かうとする","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5232,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"勇氣である。下人は、饑死をするか盜人になるかに迷は","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5256,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"なかつたばかりではない。その時のこの男の心もちから","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5280,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"云へば、饑死などと云ふ事は、殆、考へる事さへ出來な","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5304,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"い程、意識の外に追ひ出されてゐた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5328,"width":272,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5352,"width":410,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「きつと、そうか。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5352,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5376,"width":410,"height":72},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"老婆の話が完ると、下人は嘲るやうな聲で念を押した。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5376,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"さうして、一足前へ出ると、不意に、右の手を面皰から","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5400,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"離して、老婆の襟上をつかみながら、かう云つた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5424,"width":368,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5448,"width":410,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"「では、己が引剝をしようと恨むまいな。己もさうしな","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5448,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ければ、饑死をする體なのだ。」","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5472,"width":240,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5496,"width":410,"height":120},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、すばやく、老婆の着物を剝ぎとつた。それか","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5496,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、足にしがみつかうとする老婆を、手荒く屍骸の上へ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5520,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"蹴倒した。梯子の口までは、僅に五步を數へるばかりで","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5544,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ある。下人は、剝ぎとつた檜肌色の着物をわきにかゝへ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5568,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て、またゝく間に急な梯子を夜の底へかけ下りた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5592,"width":368,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5616,"width":410,"height":168},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"暫、死んだやうに倒れてゐた老婆が、屍骸の中から、そ","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5616,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"の裸の體を起したのは、それから間もなくの事である。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5640,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"老婆は、つぶやくやうな、うめくやうな聲を立てなが","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5664,"width":384,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"ら、まだ燃えてゐる火の光をたよりに、梯子の口まで、","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5688,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"這つて行つた。さうして、そこから、短い白髮を倒にし","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5712,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"て、門の下を覗きこんだ。外には、唯、黑洞々たる夜が","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5736,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"あるばかりである。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5760,"width":144,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":5784,"width":410,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下人は、既に、雨を冐して、京都の町へ强盜を働きに急","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5784,"width":400,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"いでゐた。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":5808,"width":80,"height":24}]}}]}]}]}]}}